   "subject": "RStudio / Shiny: radioButtons' List",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello :)<br><br>I am developing an app and, when choosing the country, I want the user \nto either select it from a list (selectInput) or introduce the \ncoordinates (numericInput). I have tried the following, but it didn&#39;t \nwork:\n\n<pre><code><span> <br>    radioButtons</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;country&quot;</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>&quot;Choose:&quot;</span><span>,</span><span>\n         list</span><span>(</span><span>\n           conditionalPanel</span><span>(</span><span>\n             condition</span><span>=</span><span>&quot;input.species==&#39;Cc&#39;&quot;</span><span>,</span><span>\n             selectInput</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;country&quot;</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>&quot;Country&quot;</span><span>,</span><span>\n               choices</span><span>=</span><span>subset</span><span>(</span><span>NestingArea</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>Sp</span><span>==</span><span>&quot;Cc&quot;</span><span>)</span><span>$Country</span><span>)),</span><span>\n<br>           numericInput</span><span>(</span><span>\n             inputId</span><span>=</span><span>&quot;latitude&quot;</span><span>,</span><span>\n             label</span><span>=</span><span>&quot;Latitude:&quot;</span><span>,</span><span>\n             value</span><span>=</span><span>00</span><span>,</span><span> min</span><span>=-</span><span>90</span><span>,</span><span> max</span><span>=</span><span>90</span><span>,</span><span> step</span><span>=</span><span>1</span><span>)))</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>Any suggestions?</p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sIZI1xzRAfYJ",
   "from": "Stéphane Laurent",
   "author": "129e07bdb789652f",
   "date": "2014-02-05T14:13:17Z",
   "subject": "Re: RStudio / Shiny: radioButtons' List",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>You should use a dynamic UI with renderUI.</div><div><br></div><div>In ui.R :</div><div><pre><code><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">radioButtons(&quot;choose&quot;, &quot;Choose:&quot;, list(selectInput=&quot;select&quot;, numericInput=&quot;numeric&quot;)), </font></code></pre><pre><code><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">uiOutput(&quot;widget&quot;)</font></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>In server.R :</div><div><pre><code><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">output$widget &lt;- renderUI({</font></code></pre><pre><code><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">   if(input$choose==&quot;select&quot;){</font></code></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"><code>   </code></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">return(</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">selectInput</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">&quot;country&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">&quot;Country&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">, ...))</span><br></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">   }else{</font></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">      return(numericInput(&quot;latitude&quot;, ......))</font></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">   }</font></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">})</font></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"><br></font></pre><pre><br></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"><br></font></pre></div><div><code><br></code></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
