     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial narrow,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hello Stéphane,<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial narrow,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\nThank you very much for answering :)<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial narrow,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Meanwhile I have tried other ways, and this worked for me:<br><br>\r\n    radioButtons(&quot;country_type&quot;, &quot;Choose:&quot;,<br>\r\n                 list(&quot;list&quot;, &quot;coordinates&quot;)),<br><br>    conditionalPanel(<br>      condition=&quot;input.country_type==&#39;list&#39;&quot;,</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial narrow,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      selectInput(&quot;country&quot;, &quot;Country:&quot;,<br>\r\n\r\n                  choices=subset(NestingArea, Sp==&quot;Cc&quot;)$Country)),<br><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial narrow,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">    conditionalPanel(<br>      condition=&quot;input.country_type==&#39;coordinates&#39;&quot;,<br>      numericInput(&quot;latitude&quot;, &quot;Latitude:&quot;,<br>\r\n\r\n                   value=00, min=-90, max=90, step=1),<br>      numericInput(&quot;longitude&quot;, &quot;Longitude:&quot;,<br>                   value=00, min=-180, max=180, step=1)),<br><br>....<br><br>:)<br><br></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2014-02-05 Stéphane Laurent <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lauren...@yahoo.fr</a>&gt;</span>:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>You should use a dynamic UI with renderUI.</div><div><br></div><div>In ui.R :</div><div><pre><code><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">radioButtons(&quot;choose&quot;, &quot;Choose:&quot;, list(selectInput=&quot;select&quot;, numericInput=&quot;numeric&quot;)), </font></code></pre>\r\n\r\n<pre><code><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">uiOutput(&quot;widget&quot;)</font></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>In server.R :</div><div><pre><code><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">output$widget &lt;- renderUI({</font></code></pre>\r\n\r\n<pre><code><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">   if(input$choose==&quot;select&quot;){</font></code></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"><code>   </code></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">return(</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">selectInput</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">&quot;country&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">&quot;Country&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:large\">, ...))</span><br>\r\n\r\n</pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">   }else{</font></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">      return(numericInput(&quot;latitude&quot;, ......))</font></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">   }</font></pre>\r\n\r\n<pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\">})</font></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"><br></font></pre><pre><br></pre><pre><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"><br></font></pre>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><code><br></code></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
